business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QNq_X4ImJkPKyVll_k6ViQ","review_id":"6sfZ43zKkcOaqv5yTQWqvw","date":"2017-10-12T22:49:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9471924304962158,"text_excerpt":"I love me some good mexican food! This place is really cute and quaint. The bartenders and staff are pretty great as well. Their salsas, queso dips and fried pork rinds are phenomenal! They have pretty good drink specials during happy hour. I do think the trio taco plate is a bit pricey for what you receive but it was pretty tasty. I can honestly say that everything I ate was delicious. Side note...please rinse off tops of beer cans before serving..but will for sure visit again!"},{"business_id":"QNq_X4ImJkPKyVll_k6ViQ","review_id":"-qzEqQpLYQRyTIx1c_RLIw","date":"2016-06-25T14:45:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.942538321018219,"text_excerpt":"Moving from Southern California to New Orleans meant giving up my favorite cuisine.... Mexican (no not texmex, I'm talking about Baja Mexico) Drinks- We came during happy hour (3pm-7pm). My husband started with a Juan Daly drink, it reminded me of a Starbucks Very Berry Hibiscus but with a touch of tequila. It was great! Definitely getting it next time. Appetizer- Then came the trio salsa, usually $6, but for happy hour its $3. Great price especially for how much they give you. I honestly forgot which three we got but my favorite had a citrus taste but ended off with a kick. Very good! All taste very homemade, I felt as if I were eating at my friends house in Cali. Entrees - I ordered the..."},{"business_id":"QNq_X4ImJkPKyVll_k6ViQ","review_id":"ncP6QtEa-tTt_9saUiFtTw","date":"2018-10-03T16:25:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409939050674438,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite Mexican spots in town. I usually only go for their DELICIOUS Margs and apps, but the food is also amazing. Let me tell you about these margaritas, though. They make something in house, I think its the triple sec, so these babies are strong. They come in different flavors and they're all really good. Don't quote me on it, but I think they're like 10-12 bucks each which ain't bad at all. The last time I went they used hollow pasta in the place of straws and I thought that was a really cool way to be environmentally friendly and help save the sea turtles. I love the chips that come with the salsa. They are always fresh out the fryer, crispy, and golden. Ah, Del Fuego, can'..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QNq_X4ImJkPKyVll_k6ViQ","photo_id":"HwOgfk6QMzWPyHeS_MBM_g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/HwOgfk6QMzWPyHeS_MBM_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9256278872489929},{"business_id":"QNq_X4ImJkPKyVll_k6ViQ","photo_id":"mIwy8P60N5g263NddVAzpQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mIwy8P60N5g263NddVAzpQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8567543029785156},{"business_id":"QNq_X4ImJkPKyVll_k6ViQ","photo_id":"dZAEJN4rVE48veCdLuTKOA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dZAEJN4rVE48veCdLuTKOA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8496723771095276},{"business_id":"QNq_X4ImJkPKyVll_k6ViQ","photo_id":"cEY4CcBvaM53NqbZSdjnyQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cEY4CcBvaM53NqbZSdj